      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-navy",
      "description": "Normal, presionado, deshabilitado y carga de muestra; altura mínima de 52px.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-button-stack\"><button class=\"ds-primary\">Crear viaje</button><button class=\"ds-primary ds-pressed\">Crear viaje</button><button class=\"ds-primary\" disabled>Crear viaje</button><button class=\"ds-primary ds-loading\" disabled aria-busy=\"true\">Cargando…</button><small>Estados de muestra; no hay una carga en curso.</small></div>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{font:600 14px/20px Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:var(--brand,#16324f);color:var(--on-brand,#fff);width:100%;min-height:52px;padding:16px;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary:disabled{background:var(--soft,#eaf0f6);color:var(--muted,#5e6c79);cursor:default}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#264b70);outline-offset:3px}.ds-primary:not(:disabled):hover,.ds-primary.ds-pressed{background:var(--navy-pressed,#11263a)}.ds-primary.ds-loading:disabled{background:var(--brand,#16324f);color:var(--on-brand,#fff)}.ds-button-stack{display:grid;gap:12px}.ds-button-stack small{font:400 14px/20px Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--muted,#5e6c79)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-primary{transition:background-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease}.ds-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}}"
