      "description": "Fecha seleccionada con cifras tabulares.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-day\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span>LUN</span><strong>12</strong></button>",
      "css": ".ds-day{width:50px;min-height:64px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:8px 0;font:600 12px/18px Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;background:none;color:var(--ink,#1c2c3c)}.ds-day span{color:var(--muted,#5e6c79)}.ds-day strong{font-size:18px;line-height:26px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-day[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--brand,#16324f);color:var(--on-brand,#fff)}.ds-day[aria-pressed=true] span{color:var(--on-brand-muted,#c5d5e5)}.ds-day:hover{cursor:pointer}.ds-day:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#264b70);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-day{transition:background-color 150ms ease,color 150ms ease}.ds-day:active{transform:translateY(1px)}}"
